<title>SINGAPORE: Roly acquires subsidiaries, associates.</title>
<headline>Roly acquires subsidiaries, associates.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roly International holdings Ltd, a distributor of home decor and consumer products, said on Wednesday it had bought several subsidiaries and associated companies.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it now holds 100 percent stakes in British Virgin Islands-incorporated Roly International (B.V.L.) Ltd and Patent Master Ltd and Singapore-incorporated International Home Centre Pte Ltd.</p>
<p>It also now holds a 49 percent stake in Poland-incorporated Goliat Innovations J.V. Sp.z.o.o.</p>
<p>No further details were available.  </p>
<p>On Wednesday, Roly shares ended at Singapore $0.675, unchanged from the previous day.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703083)</p>
</text>
